/-!
# Cohomology of Windows of Spec ℤ

Umbrella for the theory of windows of the scaling line: the window datum (locality, Euler-factor
locality, window involution, window criterion); the canonical class (fold identity, canonical
density at the end distances, Riesz degree); stages and folds of the prime jumps, the first-prime
fold; realizations of the window `h¹` (zero map, no finite-dimensional window cohomology); the
window index. See `CohomologyOfWindowsOfSpecZ/README.md`.
-/
